{{ds:component/hero|title=API Reference|subtitle=Every endpoint in the Godzilla REST API, with request/response examples.|cta_html=<a href="{{cms:item/cf920af0-d077-466e-bb12-bc3f186c003e}}">Start with Pipelines</a>}}

<section>
  <p>All endpoints require a bearer <a href="{{cms:item/565d0792-2247-47e1-8d71-cf2b2ed896ac}}">API key</a>. The pipelines endpoint is on v3 (<code>https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v3</code>), while all other endpoints currently live under <code>https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v2</code>. New to the API? Read <a href="{{cms:item/565d0792-2247-47e1-8d71-cf2b2ed896ac}}">Authentication</a> in Getting Started first.</p>

  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/cf920af0-d077-466e-bb12-bc3f186c003e}}|tag=Endpoint (v3)|title=Pipelines|description=Create, list, and manage pipelines via the v3 API.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/d73071fe-701c-44d7-96b3-6ec0f5c24495}}|tag=Endpoint (v2)|title=Pipelines (v2)|description=Previous v2 version of the pipelines endpoint.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/12565c25-b278-43dc-aba1-31def311efa4}}|tag=Endpoint|title=Connectors|description=Create, list, and rotate credentials for connectors.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/cc2e9b39-d44c-42c9-ad82-8ed72200e699}}|tag=Endpoint|title=Transforms|description=Create and list transform steps for a pipeline.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/1dfea1b3-6ab8-4e22-bbcb-3628c9f31c7a}}|tag=Endpoint|title=Events|description=Query and replay events that have flowed through a pipeline.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/6e2fe20d-5b70-4f5b-9216-71f1d0b736b1}}|tag=Endpoint|title=Webhooks|description=Subscribe to platform lifecycle events over outbound HTTP.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/20d3c10d-5bed-4e1c-b125-17f2b382a8e1}}|tag=Reference|title=Limits, quotas & errors|description=Standard-tier limits, pagination, and the error response shape.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/60c2fa1c-5c3d-4567-bf9f-a22910c52246}}|tag=Reference|title=Quotas & billing|description=Plan tiers, monthly event quotas, rate limits, and overage policies.}}
</section>

{{ds:component/alert|variant=info|title=Coming from v1?|body_html=<p>v2 replaced offset pagination with cursor pagination and added webhooks in place of polling. See the <a href="{{cms:item/2299b8f4-d8e1-4a61-a455-783517723514}}">migration guide</a> before switching an older integration over.</p>}}

